{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And the human</b>. When he saw that it would not be in his body itself forever, he needed to perpetuate the species. Therefore she said, \"I have acquired a man with YHWH.\" And there is no mention of the word Elohim, for behold, it is found on earth in species as it is in rank among essences. And the word 'good' is general, and so it is written, \"And Elohim saw all that He had made, and behold, it was very good,\" and evil is a portion."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:07.267732613Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}